[ti:Lighthouse]
[ar:The Vixl Examples]
[al:Demo Tapes]

[00:02.00]Out past the harbor where the cold waves break
[00:05.50]A single light is burning for my sake
[00:09.00][Chorus]
[00:09.00]Lighthouse, lighthouse, sweep across the sea
[00:12.50]Turn your golden eye and bring the ships to me
[00:16.00]
[00:18.00][Verse 2]
[00:18.00]The gulls are sleeping on the silver stone
[00:21.50]The keeper sings the tide a song alone
[00:25.00][Chorus]
[00:25.00][00:28.50]Lighthouse, lighthouse, sweep across the sea
